      "writtenOn": "2017-03-22T04:58:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not a stand alone class.  You can either make a LocalLog in the test and pass it in - there is no call in our framework where this is null.  Passing in a null and having a check here can mask errors.  You could also make a MockLocalLog class, other classes have opted to make a LocalLog instance to pass in.\n\nWifiConfigManager would have a null pointer exception - dump must not be tested with a null config passed in.\n\nIf you are worried about a null being passed in, then you can annotate the param to make sure it can\u0027t be null.",
      "parentUuid": "120deda3_87178366",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 131,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "ea74e0706306d6ff30adf6ad44c1f9f57a0d87cf",
